---
title: "Care-task reminders: resync, snooze, complete, delete"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: settling
    lg1: settled
    lg2: Breaks NoSnoozeForDeletedTask
    lg3: Path to the NoSnoozeForDeletedTask bug
  }
  class lg0 orange
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 bugPath
  s0: Settled, permission not read yet, no snooze
  s1: resync running, permission not read yet, no snooze
  s2: resync running, reminders off, no snooze
  s3: resync running + snooze tapped, reminders off, no snooze
  s4: resync running + snooze on its way, reminders off, no snooze
  s5: resync running + snooze on its way for a finished task, reminders off, no snooze
  s6: snooze on its way for a finished task, reminders off, no snooze
  s7: Settled, reminders off, a snooze for a finished or deleted task
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you switch reminders in Settings
  s1 --> s2: the app launches and reads the permission
  s2 --> s3: you tap Remind me on a reminder
  s3 --> s4: the snooze looks up the task
  s4 --> s5: you delete the cat
  s5 --> s5: the resync reads the saved tasks or the resync reads the permission or the resync reads the pending reminders or the resync removes stale reminders
  s5 --> s6: the resync finishes
  s6 --> s7: the snooze is scheduled
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 orange
  class s1 bugPath
